  "details": "Yesterday I had to download an update to start the game. When I did, I noticed that it ruined all my avatars - my hair doesn't move in any of them. Neither in the old avatars I made a few years ago, nor in the newer avatars. The best thing is that the dynamic bones work normally for the person I made avatars for in the same way. Only for me, none of them work. I didn't change anything in the avatars. When I put on avatars from the ''test'' tab - the bones work normally. But when I re-upload the avatar via Unity - nothing works. The hair doesn't move. Will there be an update that will fix this? Do I have to fix each avatar one by one? I have a lot of them, it will take a lot of time!",
